00:33:23,080 --> 00:33:25,733
You can only open
that box with a code sir.

519
00:33:25,760 --> 00:33:29,667
If anyone types the wrong
code or tries to open that box

520
00:33:30,807 --> 00:33:32,827
then the sample
will be destroyed sir.

521
00:33:33,060 --> 00:33:34,520
The sample will destruct?

522
00:33:35,087 --> 00:33:37,067
-That's good, right?
-What if it doesn't?

523
00:33:37,693 --> 00:33:39,320
How can we trust Gupta's words?

524
00:33:39,513 --> 00:33:40,899
What if it leaks?

525
00:33:41,052 --> 00:33:42,519
It will be a devastation.

526
00:33:42,750 --> 00:33:43,963
So what do we do?

527
00:33:44,567 --> 00:33:46,960
We need to forget that
such a vial and box exists.

528
00:33:46,985 --> 00:33:48,207
Just forget it Bhombol!

529
00:33:48,293 --> 00:33:50,139
Countless people
could lose their lives

530
00:33:50,300 --> 00:33:52,968
and the great Snehashish Haldar
wants us to forget it? Wonderful!

531
00:33:52,993 --> 00:33:54,793
Oh my... then don't forget it!

532
00:33:55,507 --> 00:33:57,447
When the media...
The media will find out!

533
00:33:58,333 --> 00:33:59,386
What happens then?

534
00:33:59,510 --> 00:34:03,396
There will be panic all over the
city and the country, Bhombol.

535
00:34:03,790 --> 00:34:05,880
-Do you want that?
-So we won't even try?

536
00:34:06,093 --> 00:34:08,073
He hid it in a place that
no one can find.

537
00:34:09,247 --> 00:34:11,287
Go ahead and look for it.
You won't find it.

538
00:34:12,073 --> 00:34:14,400
But... you can find it, right sir?

539
00:34:15,553 --> 00:34:17,646
He is the smartest
guy in your office.

540
00:34:18,827 --> 00:34:20,780
People will call you
Sir Jadeja in the future.

541
00:34:21,230 --> 00:34:23,326
Thank you for the compliment,
but no thank you.

542
00:34:23,813 --> 00:34:25,147
It's a difficult task.

543
00:34:26,033 --> 00:34:28,767
Find the box first,
then figure out the code,

544
00:34:28,947 --> 00:34:31,393
then open the box and if
something goes wrong...

545
00:34:32,400 --> 00:34:33,647
self-destruct.

546
00:35:13,060 --> 00:35:15,387
-Hello?
-I am disappearing Bhombol.

547
00:35:16,827 --> 00:35:18,873
Who knew about Gupta?

548
00:35:19,920 --> 00:35:22,087
You, me and your two subordinates.

549
00:35:22,680 --> 00:35:24,520
And yet this news reached Mumtaz.

550
00:35:24,813 --> 00:35:26,260
And she reached my house.

551
00:35:27,227 --> 00:35:28,427
There is some leak somewhere.

552
00:35:28,567 --> 00:35:31,407
This was done by
your two subordinates.

553
00:35:32,900 --> 00:35:34,373
You have to get
your house in order.

554
00:35:35,827 --> 00:35:37,960
Okay, why don't you
come over here and

555
00:35:38,270 --> 00:35:40,630
I will figure out what information
leaked from where, okay?

556
00:35:40,640 --> 00:35:42,760
We don't know how far
M's reach extends.

557
00:35:43,613 --> 00:35:44,813
Where are you going?

558
00:35:44,973 --> 00:35:46,720
You will know when
the time is right.

559
00:35:48,500 --> 00:35:49,900
-And Bhombol?
-Yes?

560
00:35:51,273 --> 00:35:52,533
Are you sure you're not M?

561
00:35:52,567 --> 00:35:55,180
Just shut up. I will get in this
phone and hit you on the other side.

562
00:35:57,787 --> 00:35:59,780
-Bye.
-Baabi, Baabi, listen...

563
00:36:19,375 --> 00:36:21,993
LONPUR

564
00:37:02,860 --> 00:37:03,887
Hello.

565
00:37:04,483 --> 00:37:05,530
Hello.

566
00:37:05,590 --> 00:37:06,950
I wanted a room.

567
00:37:09,680 --> 00:37:10,787
Name?

568
00:37:12,300 --> 00:37:13,313
Uh... Home.

569
00:37:15,960 --> 00:37:17,273
I know, it's...

570
00:37:18,440 --> 00:37:19,627
First name?

571
00:37:20,600 --> 00:37:23,287
She... uh... Shekhar Home.

572
00:37:24,760 --> 00:37:27,313
Shekhar Home...

573
00:37:29,433 --> 00:37:32,367
So your real name is Snehashish?

574
00:37:35,487 --> 00:37:38,373
Is that the only thing you learnt
from that whole story?

575
00:37:38,727 --> 00:37:40,320
I learnt a lot of things.

576
00:37:40,980 --> 00:37:43,100
Like lying to your closest friends.

577
00:37:44,093 --> 00:37:47,047
Like how to lie and put
other people's lives in danger.

578
00:37:48,607 --> 00:37:50,060
The one thing I don't understand,

579
00:37:50,900 --> 00:37:52,507
after hearing what Ajay Gupta said,

580
00:37:52,577 --> 00:37:54,693
you didn't try to look
for the vial even once?

581
00:37:55,833 --> 00:37:57,906
That doesn't sound like
your character my friend.

582
00:37:58,607 --> 00:38:01,133
Sometimes you need to step
out of your character to work.

583
00:38:04,047 --> 00:38:05,367
It helps build drama.

584
00:38:12,060 --> 00:38:13,413
What do we do now?

585
00:38:14,000 --> 00:38:15,627
I will introduce you to M.

586
00:38:37,267 --> 00:38:38,847
Look who is here.

587
00:38:43,680 --> 00:38:44,880
Shekhar Home.

